WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.292
JEREMY
I probably should have asked this earlier,

00:00:01.292 --> 00:00:02.709
but how much cash
do you have on you?

00:00:03.751 --> 00:00:05.334
KAMAL
Did you not bring enough money
to cover this game?

00:00:05.334 --> 00:00:06.584
JEREMY
I brought like 80...

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:08.459
...minus 60.

00:00:09.083 --> 00:00:09.876
JEREMY
You ready?

00:00:09.876 --> 00:00:10.626
KAMAL
Born ready.

00:00:11.751 --> 00:00:12.626
BASKETBALL PLAYER
What's up with your boy?

00:00:12.667 --> 00:00:13.584
KAMAL
He's almost done.

00:00:14.918 --> 00:00:16.292
JEREMY
I'm like the P.T. Anderson

00:00:16.292 --> 00:00:18.083
of basketball psychological warfare.

00:00:18.083 --> 00:00:19.125
KAMAL
Who is P.T. Anderson?

00:00:19.584 --> 00:00:21.000
JEREMY
Our greatest living director.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:22.792
KAMAL
Spike Lee is our greatest living director.

00:00:22.792 --> 00:00:24.250
JEREMY
Spike Lee is not even a good Knicks fan.

00:00:24.250 --> 00:00:25.542
KAMAL
I knew this was a mistake.

